# "As long as you have one or fewer cards in hand": the threshold is checked continuously (CR 611.3a), one card in hand still
# counts. Cast on turn one with an emptied hand, the Interpreter is a 5/5 with menace. On turn three Bot1 draws one card:
# still 5/5 with menace (one card). Cracking a Clue draws a second: 3/3 without menace (two cards). Playing the land
# leaves one card again: back to 5/5 with menace.

